    "fileId": 23039,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Meningioma of the ear",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Fragments of tissue show a meningothelial proliferation associated with innumerable variably sized psammoma bodies.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
    "copyright": "",
