    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Meningioma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Meningioma of the ear. The psammomatous subtype of meningioma is seen more commonly in the ear than in the sinonasal tract. There are usually numerous psammoma bodies within the tumour.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
    "copyright": "",
