    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Meningioma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Meningioma of the ear. The rhabdoid subtype of meningioma has eccentric eosinophilic cytoplasm in cells that show a syncytial architecture. This type of meningioma raises a different differential diagnosis than other subtypes, potentially requiring immunohistochemistry to resolve the diagnosis.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
